yer\",\"scope:public_summary\",\"revealScope:public_summary\",\"register:formal\",\"honorific:neutral\",\"audience:single\",\"tense:present\",\"relationship:spouse\",\"judgeAddress:none\",\"judgeAddressState:none\",\"callTerm:none\",\"callTermState:none\",\"counterpartyRef:none\",\"counterpartyRefState:none\",\"emotion:measured\",\"continuity:resolved\",\"disclosure:open\",\"revealGuard:open\",\"mentionTarget:result\",\"responseMode:player_summary\",\"reveal:full\"],\"sourceRefs\":[\"result:b_primary_fault\"]},{\"id\":\"b_primary_fault#2\",\"text\":\"이번 판단은 제 남편 쪽이 긴급 대응보다 통제를 앞세운 책임을 중심에 둡니다. 그렇더라도 상대방의 침범 행위까지 사라지는 것은 아니라고 적습니다.\",\"behaviorHint\":\"없음\",\"tags\":[\"channel:aftermath\",\"speaker:narrator\",\"speakerRole:narrator\",\"listener:player\",\"listenerRole:player\",\"address:toPlayer\",\"scope:public_summary\",\"revealScope:public_summary\",\"register:formal\",\"honorific:neutral\",\"audience:single\",\"tense:present\",\"relationship:spouse\",\"judgeAddress:none\",\"judgeAddressState:none\",\"callTerm:none\",\"callTermState:none\",\"counterpartyRef:none\",\"counterpartyRefState:none\",\"emotion:measured\",\"continuity:resolved\",\"disclosure:open\",\"revealGuard:open\",\"mentionTarget:result\",\"responseMode:player_summary\",\"reveal:full\"],\"sourceRefs\":[\"result:b_primary_fault\"]}]},{\"key\":\"shared_fault\",\"resultClass\":\"shared_fault\",\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"shared_fault#1\",\"text\":\"재판관은 두 사람 모두가 서로 다른 방식으로 피해를 키웠다고 봅니다. 한쪽은 침범했고 다른 한쪽은 지연했으며, 그 위에 공동 계산이 겹쳤다고 정리합니다.\",\"behaviorHint\":\"없음\",\"tags\":[\"channel:aftermath\",\"speaker:narrator\",\"speakerRole:narrator\",\"listener:player\",\"listenerRole:player\",\"address:toPlayer\",\"scope:public_summary\",\"revealScope:public_summary\",\"register:formal\",\"honorific:neutral\",\"audience:single\",\"tense:present\",\"relationship:spouse\",\"judgeAddress:none\",\"judgeAddressState:none\",\"callTerm:none\",\"callTermState:none\",\"counterpartyRef:none\",\"counterpartyRefState:none\",\"emotion:measured\",\"continuity:resolved\",\"disclosure:open\",\"revealGuard:open\",\"mentionTarget:result\",\"responseMode:player_summary\",\"reveal:full\"],\"sourceRefs\":[\"result:shared_fault\"]},{\"id\":\"shared_fault#2\",\"text\":\"이번 결론은 단일 빌런보다 결합된 잘못에 가깝습니다. 침범, 지연, 과장 설계가 함께 작동했다는 점을 공동 책임으로 묶습니다.\",\"behaviorHint\":\"없음\",\"tags\":[\"channel:aftermath\",\"speaker:narrator\",\"speakerRole:narrator\",\"listener:player\",\"listenerRole:player\",\"address:toPlayer\",\"scope:public_summary\",\"revealScope:public_summary\",\"register:formal\",\"honorific:neutral\",\"audience:single\",\"tense:present\",\"relationship:spouse\",\"judgeAddress:none\",\"judgeAddressState:none\",\"callTerm:none\",\"callTermState:none\",\"counterpartyRef:none\",\"counterpartyRefState:none\",\"emotion:measured\",\"continuity:resolved\",\"disclosure:open\",\"revealGuard:open\",\"mentionTarget:result\",\"responseMode:player_summary\",\"reveal:full\"],\"sourceRefs\":[\"result:shared_fault\"]}]},{\"key\":\"protective_resolution\",\"resultClass\":\"protective_resolution\",\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"protective_resolution#1\",\"text\":\"재판관은 추가 확산과 2차 피해 방지를 먼저 둡니다. 책임 비율은 남기되 비공개 정정과 복구 우선 조치로 결론을 좁힙니다.\",\"behaviorHint\":\"없음\",\"tags\":[\"channel:aftermath\",\"speaker:narrator\",\"speakerRole:narrator\",\"listener:player\",\"listenerRole:player\",\"address:toPlayer\",\"scope:public_summary\",\"revealScope:public_summary\",\"register:formal\",\"honorific:neutral\",\"audience:single\",\"tense:present\",\"relationship:spouse\",\"judgeAddress:none\",\"judgeAddressState:none\",\"callTerm:none\",\"callTermState:none\",\"counterpartyRef:none\",\"counterpartyRefState:none\",\"emotion:measured\",\"continuity:resolved\",\"disclosure:open\",\"revealGuard:open\",\"mentionTarget:result\",\"responseMode:player_summary\",\"reveal:full\"],\"sourceRefs\":[\"result:protective_resolution\"]},{\"id\":\"protective_resolution#2\",\"text\":\"이번 결론은 처벌 수위보다 실제 복구와 증거 정리를 먼저 요구합니다. 공개 비난은 줄이고 자료 정정, 권한 분리, 복구 재개를 우선합니다.\",\"behaviorHint\":\"없음\",\"tags\":[\"channel:aftermath\",\"speaker:narrator\",\"speakerRole:narrator\",\"listener:player\",\"listenerRole:player\",\"address:toPlayer\",\"scope:public_summary\",\"revealScope:public_summary\",\"register:formal\",\"honorific:neutral\",\"audience:single\",\"tense:present\",\"relationship:spouse\",\"judgeAddress:none\",\"judgeAddressState:none\",\"callTerm:none\",\"callTermState:none\",\"counterpartyRef:none\",\"counterpartyRefState:none\",\"emotion:measured\",\"continuity:resolved\",\"disclosure:open\",\"revealGuard:open\",\"mentionTarget:result\",\"responseMode:player_summary\",\"reveal:full\"],\"sourceRefs\":[\"result:protective_resolution\"]}]},{\"key\":\"procedural_caution\",\"resultClass\":\"procedural_caution\",\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"procedural_caution#1\",\"text\":\"재판관은 사실관계만큼 절차 붕괴를 심각하게 봅니다. 무단 접속, 잘린 캡처 유통, 축소 보고가 다시는 반복되지 않도록 절차를 먼저 세우라고 적습니다.\",\"behaviorHint\":\"없음\",\"tags\":[\"channel:aftermath\",\"speaker:narrator\",\"speakerRole:narrator\",\"listener:player\",\"listenerRole:player\",\"address:toPlayer\",\"scope:public_summary\",\"revealScope:public_summary\",\"register:formal\",\"honorific:neutral\",\"audience:single\",\"tense:present\",\"relationship:spouse\",\"judgeAddress:none\",\"judgeAddressState:none\",\"callTerm:none\",\"callTermState:none\",\"counterpartyRef:none\",\"counterpartyRefState:none\",\"emotion:measured\",\"continuity:resolved\",\"disclosure:open\",\"revealGuard:open\",\"mentionTarget:result\",\"responseMode:player_summary\",\"reveal:full\"],\"sourceRefs\":[\"result:procedural_caution\"]},{\"id\":\"procedural_caution#2\",\"text\":\"이번 결론은 누가 더 미웠는가보다 어떤 절차가 무너졌는가에 무게를 둡니다. 권한 관리, 기관 대응, 복구 보고 체계를 다시 세우라는 주문이 함께 남습니다.\",\"behaviorHint\":\"없음\",\"tags\":[\"channel:aftermath\",\"speaker:narrator\",\"speakerRole:narrator\",\"listener:player\",\"listenerRole:player\",\"address:toPlayer\",\"scope:public_summary\",\"revealScope:public_summary\",\"register:formal\",\"honorific:neutral\",\"audience:single\",\"t